Put your terraria 1.2.12785 APK and OBB in here.

For checksum purposes, make sure your apk is named "Terraria_1.2.12785.apk"
and the obb "main.12785.com.and.games505.TerrariaPaid.obb".

NOTE: if you'd like to extract the stuff manually, feel free to
extract the apk's "assets" folder to the root of the repo,
do the same with the OBB and merge its assets folder contents with the
apk's assets folder, then extract the libTerraria.so from the APK and
put it in the "lib" folder in the root of the repo.
